{"ref":"BDB, נָזִיד","hw":"נָזִיד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נָזִיד</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>thing sodden or boiled, pottage</strong>; abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:29\" href=\"/Genesis.25.29\">Gn 25:29</a> + 4 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְזִיד</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:34\" href=\"/Genesis.25.34\">Gn 25:34</a>;—a kind of boiled leguminous food, obj. of <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּ֫זֶד</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:29\" href=\"/Genesis.25.29\">Gn 25:29</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, זוּד\" href=\"/BDB,_זוּד\", dir=\"rtl\">זוּד</a> <strong>Hiph.</strong>); defined v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:34\" href=\"/Genesis.25.34\">34</a> as <span dir=\"rtl\">נְזִיד עֲדָשִׁים</span> (v. <span dir=\"rtl\">עדשׁ</span>); obj. of <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּשֵּׁל</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:38\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.38\">2 K 4:38</a>; boiled in a <span dir=\"rtl\">סִיר</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:39\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.39\">39</a> cf. v <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:40\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.40\">40</a>; mentioned, appar. as a common food, <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:12\" href=\"/Haggai.2.12\">Hg 2:12</a>.","next":"BDB, זִיז³","prev":"BDB, זֵידוֹן"}